  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀……你找我有事吗？\n打宝可梦对战的话我乐意奉陪哦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440202620264F60627E621167094E8B5417FF1F000A62535B9D53EF68A65BF9621876848BDD62114E50610F5949966A54E6300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "顺带问一下，你是那种会\n靠近对手死缠烂打的人吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "987A5E2695EE4E004E0BFF0C4F60662F90A379CD4F1A000A97608FD15BF9624B6B7B7F2070C2625376844EBA5417FF1F00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "从远处攻击那样的对手，\n机智地进行战斗是我的原则。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ECE8FDC5904653B51FB90A3683776845BF9624BFF0C000A673A667A57308FDB884C62186597662F62117684539F5219300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因此我会巧妙地引导我的宝可梦，\n边保持距离边战斗。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E06B6462114F1A5DE7599957305F155BFC621176845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A8FB94FDD63018DDD79BB8FB962186597300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然能从远处使出的招式\n需要的发动时间有点……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713680FD4ECE8FDC59044F7F51FA768462DB5F0F000A97008981768453D152A865F695F4670970B92026202600100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀……我话说得有点多了。\n接下来的内容就通过实战来学习吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE54402026202662118BDD8BF45F97670970B9591A4E863002000A63A54E0B6765768451855BB95C31901A8FC75B9E621867655B664E605427300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你准备好要通过实战来学习了，\n就跟我说一声吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F6051C65907597D8981901A8FC75B9E621867655B664E604E86FF0C000A5C318DDF62118BF44E0058F05427300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你准备好要输给我了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6051C65907597D89818F937ED962114E865417FF1F00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我准备好要打赢你了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621151C65907597D898162538D624F604E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也是很忙的哦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E5F662F5F885FD9768454E6300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的兴趣就是……\n与对手保持距离，机智地进行战斗！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211768451748DA35C31662F20262026000A4E0E5BF9624B4FDD63018DDD79BBFF0C673A667A57308FDB884C62186597FF0100100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你还挺强嘛……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608FD8633A5F3A561B20262026FF0100100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没错！使用远程招式\n需要花一点时间。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA19519FF014F7F75288FDC7A0B62DB5F0F000A9700898182B14E0070B965F695F4300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "相反，使用相对近程的招式\n则需要通过移动接近对手。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76F853CDFF0C4F7F752876F85BF98FD17A0B768462DB5F0F000A521997008981901A8FC779FB52A863A58FD15BF9624B300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以如果能接近对手出招的话，\n使用近程招式会更有利。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55982679C80FD63A58FD15BF9624B51FA62DB76848BDDFF0C000A4F7F75288FD17A0B62DB5F0F4F1A66F467095229300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算是这样，我还是会坚持用\n拉开距离对战这种机智的战术。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C317B97662F8FD96837FF0C62118FD8662F4F1A575A63017528000A62C95F008DDD79BB5BF962188FD979CD673A667A76846218672F300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "毕竟对战中的宝可梦们太拼命了，\n要接近它们实在是太可怕了呀！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD57ADF5BF962184E2D76845B9D53EF68A64EEC592A62FC547D4E86FF0C000A898163A58FD15B834EEC5B9E5728662F592A53EF60154E865440FF01FF0100100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "远程的招式发动得很慢，\n而只能近程攻击的招式发动会较快。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n要灵活地选用招式哦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FDC7A0B768462DB5F0F53D152A85F975F886162FF0C000A800C53EA80FD8FD17A0B653B51FB768462DB5F0F53D152A84F1A8F835FEB300200100001BE00000A898170756D3B57309009752862DB5F0F54E6300200100002011401280000",
